" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>det</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{det}}(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">det</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是按超期天数递增的阶梯费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{free}}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 只箱子的免费期天数。审计的核心工作，就是逐个验证这四个边界值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{free}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>gate-out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{gate-out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gate-out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与每档 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是否与运价本一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率结构与计费单位\">费率结构与计费单位</h2><p>D&amp;D 不做线性定价，而采用<strong>阶梯递增</strong>（tiered per diem）：免费期内为零，之后逐档抬高。典型结构是第一档（如第 8–12 天）低价、第二档（第 13–17 天）中价、第三档（第 18 天起）高价，目的是用边际成本的陡增逼迫货方尽快还箱。这使得<strong>一只箱子多滞留一天的边际费用</strong>随滞留时长非线性上升——洞察这一点，就能理解为什么「早三天还一只箱子」的收益远高于直觉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶梯档位</th>\n<th>典型相对费率</th>\n<th>设计意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免费期</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>覆盖正常清关与拆箱周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第一档</td>\n<td>1×</td>\n<td>覆盖轻度延误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二档</td>\n<td>2–3×</td>\n<td>抑制长期占用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三档及以后</td>\n<td>4× 以上</td>\n<td>强制回归流转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计费单位统一为「每箱每天」（per container per day），但需注意天数不足一天按一天计、且跨周末与法定节假日是否计费在运价本中常有例外条款。出口侧同理：Demurrage 从进港闸口起算，Detention 从提空箱起算。跨境电商小包拼箱（LCL）场景下，计费单位会退化为「每 CBM 每天」或按整箱分摊，口径差异更大。</p>\n<p>自 2023 年以来，DCSA（Digital Container Shipping Association，数字集装箱航运协会）推动 D&amp;D 数据的标准化与电子发票互操作，目标是让费用事件、免费期与争议状态以结构化字段在承运人、码头与货方系统间流转，替代目前大量依赖 PDF 与邮件的处理方式。截至 2026 年，主要班轮公司已在其门户中提供 D&amp;D 明细查询接口，但跨承运人的字段口径尚未完全统一，这也是 D&amp;D 审计工具需要维护多套映射规则的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>边界判别口诀</strong>：在港区内超期是 Demurrage，出港区后超期是 Detention；进口先 Demurrage 后 Detention，出口同理。</li>\n<li><strong>收费主体由合同相对性决定</strong>，不是由谁提箱决定；卡车司机一般不应被直接开票（FMC 依据 OSRA 2022 制定的计费规则）。</li>\n<li><strong>免费期的时钟起点，而非长度，才是最大争议源</strong>：货物事实上不可提的时段不应计入（FMC 2020 解释性规则的激励原则）。</li>\n<li><strong>Detention 的结束条件（还箱）比起点更容易被做手脚</strong>：还箱点关闭、变更堆场、闸口漏记都会虚增天数。</li>\n<li><strong>程序性权利要主动使用</strong>：发票须在 30 天内开出，争议期不少于 30 天，承运人不得因争议停止服务。</li>\n<li><strong>费率是阶梯递增的</strong>，边际滞留成本随时间陡增，早还箱的收益非线性。</li>\n<li>工程化治理的落点是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>free</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{free}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">free</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>gate-out</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{gate-out}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gate-out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 四个量做成可核验的事件状态机，而不是事后比对 PDF 账单。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>FMC, <em>Interpretive Rule on Demurrage and Detention under the Shipping Act</em>, Docket No. 19-04, 85 FR 29638 (2020-05-18), fmc.gov</li>\n<li>Ocean Shipping Reform Act of 2022, Pub. L. 117-146 (签署于 2022-06-16)</li>\n<li>46 CFR Part 541 (Subpart B, §541.4), Demurrage and Detention Billing Requirements, eCFR, ecfr.gov</li>\n<li>DCSA Demurrage &amp; Detention standards, dcsa.org</li>\n<li>World Shipping Council, 关于 D&amp;D 与供应链可预测性的行业说明, worldshipping.org</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Demurrage 与 Detention 的定义边界、收费主体与起算口径","id":"demurrage-与-detention-的定义边界-收费主体与起算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"物理边界：谁在占用谁的资产","id":"物理边界-谁在占用谁的资产"},{"level":2,"text":"收费主体与 bill-to 责任链","id":"收费主体与-bill-to-责任链"},{"level":2,"text":"免费期与时钟起算口径","id":"免费期与时钟起算口径"},{"level":2,"text":"费率结构与计费单位","id":"费率结构与计费单位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"承运人费率表、免费期条款与阶梯计费契约建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/carrier-tariff-free-time-contract-terms"}}